而且我们可以在海边玩水。”\nC. 没有不合适的话\nD. “妈妈，我们可以去爬山吗？那里风景很美！”","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.002472623303650189,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af592219aa9dc5a833d73ab","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794478625211,"createTime":"2026-11-12 18:17:05","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"319968ed24124fcb9b1f05c40ee9568d"}